Dear Harry

I'm sorry to hear that you've been having a negative experience. It would be useful for me to hear more about the situation, so could we meet to discuss it as soon as possible? I'll be on campus tomorrow, and available via Teams on Friday if you can let me know your availability.

Yours sincerely,
Steven Godby.
