Hello Steven,

I'd like to raise a formal complaint about Bahar Aciksoz.

For the past few lessons, I've been singled out with what seems like verbal hostility and attacks.

I've tried to maintain a friendly face, but the boundary has been pushed today, and I need this situation put to an end.

The situation is worsened by the fact that this comes after the acknowledgment of a Statement of Access for anxiety. Everything was going fine up until this point.

Thanks

Harry Wright (N0605150)
MSc Smart Agriculture (Course Rep)
